    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-σπασμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tearing away, severing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.77c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεύρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).736
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>being torn away, separation, severance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς συνοδίας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.3.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀναγκαιοτάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					p.4O.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μοὶ τῆς ψυχῆς ἀπὸ τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
